-- VERIFICATION: Credential-free Debug and Release host builds, both Swift Testing target suites (5 host and 4 provider tests), the deterministic workspace gate, strict Swift format lint, all 443 SwiftPM tests, `git diff --check`, and `task-board validate` exit 0.
